<title>SPAIN: Spain bourse to extend preopening on April 29, 30.</title>
<headline>Spain bourse to extend preopening on April 29, 30.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish stock market will extend its pre-opening period from 0700 GMT to 0800 GMT from the normal 0730 GMT to 0800 GMT on April 29 and 30, the bourse said on Friday.</p>
<p>The note explained that the decision is due to the privatisation offer on Repsol.</p>
<p>On April 29 and April 30 the trading hours will be as follows, preopening from 0700 GMT to 0800 GMT, and trading from 0800 GMT to 1500 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
